================================================================================
KEY FINDINGS SUMMARY
================================================================================

INITIALIZATION:
- Command: rails new app_name --database=postgresql --css=tailwind --skip-test
- Hotwire (Turbo + Stimulus) included by default
- Start with: ./bin/dev (runs Rails + Tailwind watch)

TAILWIND CSS:
- Automatically configured with --css=tailwind flag
- Uses tailwindcss-rails gem
- No additional setup needed

DEVISE:
- Standard installation: bundle add devise, rails generate devise:install
- CRITICAL: Requires Turbo compatibility fixes for flash messages
- Must configure config.navigational_formats or custom failure app

RSPEC:
- Recommended gems: rspec-rails, factory_bot_rails, shoulda-matchers
- Prefer request/system specs over controller specs
- Use webmock for external service stubbing

VIEWCOMPONENT:
- Install: bundle add view_component, rails generate view_component:install
- Organization: Use namespaces (UI::, Marketing::, etc.)
- Best practices: Composition over inheritance, slots for markup

SERVICE OBJECTS:
- Location: app/services/
- Organization: Namespace grouping (Users::, Payments::, etc.)
- Pattern: Single public method (#call), return result objects

RAILS 7.2 CHANGES:
- Breaking: Ruby 3.1+ required, Puma threads reduced to 3
- Performance: YJIT enabled by default (15-25% boost)
- New: Rate limiting, allow_browser, RuboCop/Brakeman included

